    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Chandigarh to Vizag | Safe Long-Distance Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Chandigarh to Vizag?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average door‑to‑door Car Transport From Chandigarh To Vizag takes between 14 and 16 hours of continuous highway travel, depending on traffic and weather. Our GPS‑enabled fleet follows the NH 44 and NH 16 corridor, and we provide real‑time updates so you can track progress at every mile.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are in place to prevent scratches or dents during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system, hydraulic ramp trailers with anti‑scratch pads, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Every vehicle is inspected before loading, and our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers any unforeseen damage, giving you a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I get an instant online quote for my car transport from Chandigarh to Vizag?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our instant quote engine requires three inputs—vehicle make and model, desired service level, and pickup date—to generate a transparent price for Car Transport From Chandigarh To Vizag within seconds. The quote includes mileage, loading, insurance, and any optional services.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Which documents must I provide for interstate car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid GST invoice, e‑Way bill, vehicle registration copy, insurance declaration, and a government‑issued ID of the owner. Our team assists you in preparing each document, ensuring smooth customs clearance and compliance with IBA mover code regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer door‑to‑door service for both pickup and delivery?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our Car Transport From Chandigarh To Vizag includes a full door‑to‑door experience: a pre‑move inspection at your Chandigarh address, secure loading onto our specialized trailer, monitored transit, and a post‑move inspection at your Vizag destination, all backed by 24/7 CCTV surveillance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the price, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Insurance is bundled in the quoted price and provides 100 % declared‑value coverage under an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. It protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities throughout the Chandigarh‑to‑Vizag journey, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does your service differ from other car transport companies in India?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our service stands out with a dedicated fleet of 120+ hydraulic ramp trailers, live GPS tracking, a zero‑scratch guarantee, ISO 9001:2015 quality management, and IBA‑approved mover code compliance. Combined with our 4.9/5 Google rating, we deliver reliability that many generic &quot;good car transport companies&quot; cannot match.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
